# Autonomous Loop

- Follow the root `AGENTS.md` and its SolarDream product/design references.
- Continue through implementation phases without asking for confirmation. Make reversible, scoped decisions and report material risks after the work is complete.
- After each queued task, run `npm run typecheck`, `npm run lint`, and `npm run test`. Fix failures up to three times; then revert only the task-owned files or hunks and document the failure in `REVIEW_INBOX.md`.
- Never use a broad restore command in a dirty worktree. Preserve pre-existing staged, unstaged, and untracked work.
- Commit only the task-owned changes. Update `STATE.md` after each task and use the exact review-card format in `REVIEW_INBOX.md` for important changes.
